Optimized Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) framework using semantic embeddings and similarity indexing for enhanced response quality. Engineered a ranking module with a min-heap for efficient top-K document selection, reducing latency over full sorting. Integrated SentenceTransformers and Chroma Vector Store for high-dimensional embedding and similarity indexing. Developed a composite scoring system (semantic, keyword, domain weighting) for grounded, accurate responses and minimal hallucinations
